<title>UK: BOE allots 655 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 655 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 655 million stg of assistance to offset this morning's estimated money market shortage of 1.9 billion stg.</p>
<p>It allotted 605 million stg in bills outright maturing on or before April 7 and 50 million stg in repos to April 4 and April 7.</p>
<p>The repo rate was unchanged at 6.0 percent.</p>
</text>
